populi Sen. coadunatum more solito in ecclesia sci Chri-<lb/>
stofori ad sonum campane a domino <persName xml:id="pn1a" next="#pn1b" ref="nognd">Francisco Trogi-</persName>             <lb/>
<pb n="160" facs="#f0178"/>
<persName xml:id="pn1b" prev="#pn1a" ref="nognd">sio</persName> dei et domini Regis Cecilie gratia <placeName>Senarum</placeName> pote-<lb/>
stati et a domino Roffredo de Isola eadem gratia capi-<lb/>
taneo comunis et populi Sen. fuit in concordia, <hi rendition="#g">quod<lb/>
novem Boni homines scilicet tres per terze-<lb/>
rium debeant eligi ad ordinandum et provi-<lb/>
dendum, qualiter procedatur in opere s&#x0305;c&#x0305;e&#x0305; Ma-<lb/>
rie</hi> et quomodo ibi laboretur, et quod ordinaverint et<lb/>
