busdam <hi rendition="#g">testibus falsis,</hi> quos depinxit in patio communis <placeName>Sena-<lb/>
rum</placeName>.&#x201C; Archiv. cit. B. To. 84. 1288. (1289.). Item CXIII. Lib. III.<lb/>
