<p>                 <hi rendition="#aq">fo. 5. Locatio casse s. <persName ref="http://d-nb.info/gnd/131726870">Zenobii</persName> <persName ref="http://d-nb.info/gnd/118539086">Laurentio Barto-<lb/>
